  "cards": [
    {
      "id": "arrival",
      "title": "Noboribetsu",
      "kind": "intro",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "text": "{登別|のぼりべつ}"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "のぼりべつ"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Noboribetsu"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Noboribetsu is one of Hokkaido's famous hot-spring destinations, and Jigokudani is one of its major attractions."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "登"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**のぼる / とう**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "climb / ascend"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{別|べつ}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**べつ / わかれる**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "separate / different"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Together:"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{登別|のぼりべつ}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**のぼりべつ**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "Noboribetsu"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "inside_noboribetsu",
      "title": "Inside 登別",
      "kind": "content",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Look inside the name of {登別|のぼりべつ}. Each kanji can be broken into parts - and parts are clues."
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_登",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_別",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "radicalRef",
          "id": "radical_hatsugashira"
        },
        {
          "type": "radicalRef",
          "id": "radical_katana"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "text": "登 is filed under 癶 (footsteps): climbing is done on foot. 別 carries 刀 (blade, written 刂 on the right side): to cut apart. Components are clues, not magic definitions.",
          "tone": "tip"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "card_02",
      "title": "登",
      "kind": "content",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "text": "{登る|のぼる}"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "のぼる"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**noboru**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "to climb"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This is a verb."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{山|やま}に{登ります|のぼります}。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**やまに のぼります。**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Yama ni noborimasu.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "I climb a mountain."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The kanji 登 therefore gives us another useful connection:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**登 → climb → mountain**"
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Connected knowledge"
        },
        {
          "type": "vocabRef",
          "id": "vocab_登る"
        },
        {
          "type": "sentenceRef",
          "id": "sent_hokkaido_noboribetsu_climb"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "card_03",
      "title": "別",
      "kind": "content",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "text": "{別|べつ}"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "べつ"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**betsu**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "different / separate"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Example:"
